#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:1 2c4e79a249a346afac0774fb7721e51b
msgid "🚀 Getting started"
msgstr "🚀 入门"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:3 86fcea95080e46fba3d45d00c36883b5
msgid ""
"This page shows you how to build the modules on your computer and try "
"them in Minecraft."
msgstr "本页介绍如何在你的电脑上构建模块，并在 Minecraft 中试用它们。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:7 607374d7e7ad4600b2705a3420b021cb
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "准备工作"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:9 67f36537cc064eb1b3ab7da60eb4b7c3
msgid ""
"Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/). "
"It's a Python package and project manager. It installs Python and the "
"project tools the first time you run a command."
msgstr ""
"安装 [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)。它是 "
"Python 的包和项目管理器。首次运行命令时，它会安装 Python 和项目所需的工具。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:10 df389d45a51d4d678a40a7132b398b37
msgid ""
"Clone the repository. If you're new to GitHub, follow the [First "
"Contributions guide](https://github.com/firstcontributions/first-"
"contributions/blob/main/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"克隆仓库。如果你刚接触 GitHub，请参阅[首次贡献指南](https://github.com/firstcontributions"
"/first-contributions/blob/main/README.md)。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:11 7a2031e82cf24ea3abc7bfbd4252c134
msgid "Open the project folder in your code editor."
msgstr "用你的代码编辑器打开项目文件夹。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:13 e5ce467ec2514f4984c5bd2f592eefb5
msgid "Editor support"
msgstr "编辑器支持"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:16 4f3ca8dcb21643d29eac39e4db359b0a
msgid ""
"If you use VS Code, install the recommended `mcbookshelf.vscode-bsdoc` "
"extension. It helps you edit [module.bs files](project:metadata.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用 VS Code，请安装推荐的 `mcbookshelf.vscode-bsdoc` 扩展。它可以帮助你编辑 [module.bs "
"文件](project:metadata.md)。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:21 9b0895ff152342638b237a84b6641070
msgid "Build the modules"
msgstr "构建模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:23 35648f47248842038841f35bc160a256
msgid ""
"The `modules` folder contains the source files of every module. These "
"commands build them into the `build` folder:"
msgstr "`modules` 文件夹包含所有模块的源文件。以下命令将它们构建到 `build` 文件夹中："

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:26 9fde462c80264ad0a52265c2249cad76
msgid "`uv run build`"
msgstr "`uv run build`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:27 fad7426566824f968b1a40ce3cd6a818
msgid "Build all modules"
msgstr "构建所有模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:28 bf264b50e9e5464db722b7b51b829517
msgid "`uv run watch`"
msgstr "`uv run watch`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:29 38bedd89d21947e9963c1b6785fe44ab
msgid "Build all modules, then build them again each time a file changes"
msgstr "构建所有模块，并在每次文件变更时重新构建"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:30 cf900c3c629a4d05ae19e75de6c6c260
msgid "`uv run <build|watch> <name1> ...`"
msgstr "`uv run <build|watch> <name1> ...`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:31 a252cc0112d147dab7bd7cde37ddb6a9
msgid "Build or watch only the modules, bundles, or examples you name"
msgstr "仅构建或监视你指定的模块、捆绑包或示例"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:34 626ac6609e034af39ef274be54368ae5
msgid "Watch one module"
msgstr "监视单个模块"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:37 8e4a85c1bdb84eea98e4ef29eb69d0c8
msgid ""
"A full build takes time. Watch only the module you work on: `uv run watch"
" <module>`."
msgstr "完整构建需要一些时间。请只监视你正在处理的模块：`uv run watch <module>`。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:43 9c9e6981ca434fcb9adf390fa7afb3b0
msgid "Link to Minecraft"
msgstr "链接到 Minecraft"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:45 ba7a2cd38e4a441dacf2eb75272a0c12
msgid ""
"The `link` command connects the `build` folder to a Minecraft world. Each"
" build then copies the packs to that world."
msgstr "`link` 命令将 `build` 文件夹连接到一个 Minecraft 世界。此后每次构建都会把包复制到该世界。"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:48 4cf3d304dac14ca4badab9b399b47fb4
msgid "`world`"
msgstr "`world`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:49 12cd9238b6ce4773bc0e990d21806fd4
msgid "The name of the Minecraft world to link"
msgstr "要链接的 Minecraft 世界名称"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:50 a6173d37989342aa98b3be48070acfb6
msgid "`--minecraft <DIRECTORY>`"
msgstr "`--minecraft <DIRECTORY>`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:51 850aeb8f47da4b98909a358a0ccb4561
msgid "Path to the `.minecraft` directory"
msgstr "`.minecraft` 目录的路径"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:52 89c43c5fa4df4a9ab380a5b770f6f52d
msgid "`--data-pack <DIRECTORY>`"
msgstr "`--data-pack <DIRECTORY>`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:53 bdf1c8b76819401cb8c2d120f62be8f5
msgid "Path to the data packs directory"
msgstr "数据包目录的路径"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:54 4df02d71a2fe41549801d1d89e7bb26a
msgid "`--resource-pack <DIRECTORY>`"
msgstr "`--resource-pack <DIRECTORY>`"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:55 cd3ed0887ab04985bf0867326212e51f
msgid "Path to the resource packs directory"
msgstr "资源包目录的路径"

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:58 46b1fccdf46c465ca887c60b2a975177
msgid "To test a module while you work on it:"
msgstr "要在开发模块时测试它："

#: ../../contribute/getting-started.md:68 7fd53a1a817b46548052e891ad4bf831
msgid "The `watch` command also reloads the world after each build."
msgstr "`watch` 命令还会在每次构建后重新加载世界。"

